==Trivia==
This card forms part of a {{TCGP|narrative illustration|perspective illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Jigglypuff|58}} from the same set; both cards' illustrations originated from {{TCG|DPt-P Promotional cards}}.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|DPt-P Promo|Chatot|32}}, a {{TCG|DPt-P Promotional cards|DPt-P Promotional card}} only released in Japan.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Chatot|139}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*'''Spinning Draw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Hitmontop|72}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Alpha Sapphire}}.

